# Dedicated pip hub for the JTRP-5023 RCI trajectory pipeline.
#
# The shared `ml_infra_cuda` hub combines torch with `jax-cuda12==0.5.0`,
# `tensorflow-cpu`, and a long list of research deps. That combination
# forces a stale `torch==2.0.1` (the only torch version pip-tools can
# resolve alongside jax-cuda12's pinned nvidia-* wheel set), which is
# too old for the YOLO26 weights that the project actually needs.
#
# This file holds *only* the JTRP pipeline's deps so the resolver can
# pull torch from the PyTorch wheel index (`+cu126` local-version) and
# ultralytics 8.5+ without fighting jax.
--extra-index-url https://download.pytorch.org/whl/cu126

